test_wmma.mojo is a modified copy of max/kernels/test/gpu/basics/test_wmma.mojo in
https://github.com/modular/modular at commit bbc13a719b6c139ede763f1434a4342ebfd843ac
(bbc13a71). It keeps Modular's header, which reads:

